sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Messaging UI
    participant REST as Messaging REST
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant EV as AFTER_COMMIT listener
    participant WS as STOMP user queue

    U->>FE: View received message at chat end
    FE->>REST: PUT /api/v1/conversations/{id}/read
    REST->>DB: Lock member and validate message
    alt Marker is stale
        REST-->>FE: updated=false
    else Marker advances
        REST->>DB: Update last_read_message_id and last_read_at
        REST->>DB: Commit
        REST-->>FE: updated=true and totalUnreadCount
        DB-->>EV: MESSAGES_READ after commit
        EV->>DB: Requery marker, Block and unread per user
        EV->>WS: Send reader and other participant
        WS-->>FE: Advance marker only
    end
